[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3064\u3044\u306B\u5927\u4F1A\u672C\u756A\u3001\u59CB\u307E\u308A\u307E\u3059\u306D\uFF01\n\u3046\u3045\u30FC\uFF01\u3000\u6226\u3005\u6050\u3005\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The tournament\u0027s finally starting!\nOooh! I\u0027m so nervous...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u3088\u308A\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u304C\u7DCA\u5F35\u3057\u3066\u3069\u3046\u3059\u308B\u3002\n\u76EE\u6307\u3059\u306F\u512A\u52DD\u3002\u7279\u8A13\u306E\u6210\u679C\u3092\u898B\u305B\u3066\u3084\u308D\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027re more nervous than I am.\nOur goal is victory. Let\u0027s show them what our training has achieved."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2015\u2015\u3055\u3042\u3001\u59CB\u307E\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\n\u661F\u8A95\u796D\u8A18\u5FF5\u5927\u4F1A\uFF01\n\u661F\u306B\u3075\u3055\u308F\u3057\u3044\u7F8E\u3057\u3044\u5FC3\u306E\u6301\u3061\u4E3B\u306F\u8AB0\u3060\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And now, it begins!\nThe Starbirth Festival Tournament!\nWho has the most beautiful heart worthy of the stars!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u53F8\u4F1A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Host"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u306E\u5927\u4F1A\u3067\u306F\u3001\u51FA\u5834\u8005\u3068\u52A9\u624B\u306E\n\u95A2\u4FC2\u6027\u306E\u7F8E\u3057\u3055\u3082\u5BE9\u67FB\u306E\u5BFE\u8C61\u3068\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3059\uFF01\n\u305D\u308C\u3067\u306F\u5F35\u308A\u5207\u3063\u3066\u3044\u304D\u307E\u3057\u3087\u30FC\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "In this tournament, we\u0027ll also be judging\nthe relationship between contestants and their assistants!\nNow, let\u0027s begin with enthusiasm!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u53F8\u4F1A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Host"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u3053\u304B\u3089\u306F\u3001\u63D0\u793A\u3055\u308C\u305F\u304A\u984C\u306B\u5BFE\u3057\u3066\n\u81EA\u7531\u89E3\u7B54\u3067\u304A\u7B54\u3048\u3044\u305F\u3060\u304D\u307E\u3059\uFF01\n\u52A9\u624B\u306E\u65B9\u3068\u5354\u529B\u3057\u3066\u3082\u69CB\u3044\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "From here on, you\u0027ll be given topics\nto answer freely!\nFeel free to work with your assistant!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u53F8\u4F1A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Host"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3001\u56F0\u3063\u305F\u3089\n\u52A9\u624B\u306E\u79C1\u304C\u304A\u52A9\u3051\u3057\u307E\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna, if you\u0027re stuck,\nI\u0027ll help as your assistant!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3042\u3001\u3088\u308D\u3057\u304F\u983C\u3080",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, I\u0027m counting on you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u306F\u7B2C\u4E00\u554F\uFF01\u3000\u5F8C\u8F29\u304C\u604B\u611B\u76F8\u8AC7\u3092\u3057\u3066\u304D\u305F\uFF01\n\u300C\u3069\u3046\u3059\u308C\u3070\u3044\u3044\u304B\u5206\u304B\u3089\u306A\u304F\u3066\u2026\u2026\uFF01\u300D\n\u306A\u3093\u3068\u52A9\u8A00\u3059\u308B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Here\u0027s the first question! A junior comes to you for love advice!\n\u0022I don\u0027t know what to do...!\u0022\nWhat advice would you give?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u53F8\u4F1A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Host"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u604B\u611B\u76F8\u8AC7\u2026\u2026\u3080\u3080",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Love advice... hmm..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u304C\u89E3\u7B54\u306B\u56F0\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\uFF01\n\u3000\u3053\u3053\u306F\u79C1\u304C\u304A\u52A9\u3051\u3057\u306A\u304F\u3066\u306F\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Juna\u0027s having trouble with the answer!\nI need to help her!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u767D\u591C\u306E\u9A0E\u58EB\u3089\u3057\u304F\u3001\u53B3\u3057\u304F\u3044\u304D\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let\u0027s be strict, like a Knight of the Midnight Sun!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u767D\u591C\u306E\u9A0E\u58EB\u3089\u3057\u304F\u3001\u53B3\u3057\u304F\u3044\u304D\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let\u0027s be strict, like a Knight of the Midnight Sun!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5206\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3002\n\u2026\u2026\u305D\u3046\u3060\u306A\u3001\u79C1\u306A\u3089\u3053\u3046\u8A00\u3046\u3060\u308D\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Understood.\n...Yes, this is what I would say."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u300C\u5F31\u6C17\u306B\u306A\u308B\u306A\uFF01\u3000\u5F53\u305F\u3063\u3066\u7815\u3051\u308D\uFF01\u300D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "\u0022Don\u0027t be weak! Charge in head-first!\u0022"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u304F\u3001\u7815\u3051\u3061\u3083\u30C0\u30E1\u30FC\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(N-no, don\u0027t charge in and break\u2014!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u9A0E\u58EB\u3068\u3057\u3066\u306E\u53B3\u3057\u3055\u306F\u7F6E\u3044\u3066\u7B54\u3048\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let\u0027s put aside knightly strictness for now!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u9A0E\u58EB\u3068\u3057\u3066\u306E\u53B3\u3057\u3055\u306F\u7F6E\u3044\u3066\u7B54\u3048\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let\u0027s put aside knightly strictness for now!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3042\u3001\u5206\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3002\u2026\u2026\u305D\u3046\u3060\u306A\u3001\n\u3069\u3093\u306A\u5F8C\u8F29\u306A\u306E\u304B\u306B\u3082\u3088\u308B\u3068\u306F\u601D\u3046\u304C\u3001",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, I understand. Well...\nIt depends on the junior, but..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u300C\u304A\u524D\u306B\u306F\u304A\u524D\u306E\u826F\u3055\u304C\u3042\u308B\u3002\u305D\u308C\u3092\n\u6D3B\u304B\u3057\u3066\u3044\u3053\u3046\u300D\u2026\u2026\u3060\u308D\u3046\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "\u0022You have your own charm.\nLet\u0027s make the most of that\u0022...something like that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u7D20\u6575\u3067\u3059\uFF01\n\u3000\u89B3\u5BA2\u306E\u53CD\u5FDC\u3082\u826F\u3055\u3052\u3067\u3059\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Juna is so wonderful!\nThe audience seems to like it too!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5F8C\u8F29\u3055\u3093\u3092\u3001\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u306C\u3044\u3050\u308B\u307F\u3068\u601D\u3063\u3066\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Think of your junior as a cute stuffed animal!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5F8C\u8F29\u3055\u3093\u3092\u3001\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u306C\u3044\u3050\u308B\u307F\u3068\u601D\u3063\u3066\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Think of your junior as a cute stuffed animal!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3080\u2026\u2026\u305D\u3046\u3060\u306A\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm... well..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u30C0\u30E1\u3060\u3001\u8A00\u8449\u304C\u51FA\u3066\u3053\u306A\u3044\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...No good, I can\u0027t find the words...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3092\u3088\u308A\u56F0\u3089\u305B\u3066\u3057\u307E\u3063\u305F\uFF01\n\u3000\u79C1\u306E\u30D0\u30AB\u30D0\u30AB\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I just made Juna more uncomfortable!\nStupid me, stupid!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7D9A\u3044\u3066\u7B2C\u4E8C\u554F\uFF01\u3000\u5148\u8F29\u304C\u4ED5\u4E8B\u3067\u9593\u9055\u3044\u3092\uFF01\n\u300C\u3053\u306E\u4ED5\u4E8B\u3082\u3082\u3046\u5341\u5E74\u76EE\u306A\u306E\u306B\u306A\u2026\u2026\u300D\n\u306A\u3093\u3068\u58F0\u3092\u304B\u3051\u308B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now for the second question! A senior makes a mistake at work!\n\u0022And I\u0027ve been doing this job for ten years...\u0022\nWhat would you say to them?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u53F8\u4F1A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Host"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u9593\u9055\u3044\u304B\u2026\u2026\n\u305D\u308C\u306F\u6CE8\u610F\u305B\u306D\u3070\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A mistake...\nThat needs to be addressed."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u306F\u666E\u6BB5\u304B\u3089\u8FEB\u529B\u304C\u3042\u308B\u3046\u3048\u3001\n\u3000\u5927\u4F1A\u3067\u7DCA\u5F35\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u4ECA\u306F\u8FEB\u529B\u5897\u3057\u5897\u3057\uFF01\n\u3000\u305D\u308C\u3092\u548C\u3089\u3052\u3066\u89E3\u7B54\u3057\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3046\u306B\u306F\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Juna\u0027s usually intense, and now she\u0027s even more\nintimidating due to tournament nerves!\nTo help her give a softer answer...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u843D\u3061\u3064\u3044\u3066\u3001\u3051\u3069\u9A0E\u58EB\u306E\u5A01\u53B3\u3092\u5FD8\u308C\u305A\u306B\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Stay calm, but maintain knightly dignity!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u843D\u3061\u7740\u3044\u3066\u3001\u3051\u3069\u9A0E\u58EB\u306E\u5A01\u53B3\u3092\u5FD8\u308C\u305A\u306B\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Stay calm, but maintain knightly dignity!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3042\u3002\u9A0E\u58EB\u305F\u308B\u3082\u306E\u3001\u9593\u9055\u3044\u306F\u8A31\u3055\u308C\u306A\u3044\u3002\n\u79C1\u306A\u3089\u5148\u8F29\u306B\u3053\u3046\u8A00\u3046\u3060\u308D\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. As knights, mistakes are unacceptable.\nThis is what I would say to a senior."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u300C\u6211\u3005\u767D\u591C\u306E\u9A0E\u58EB\u306F\u3001\u4ED6\u306E\u9A0E\u58EB\u306E\u6A21\u7BC4\u3067\n\u306A\u3051\u308C\u3070\u3044\u3051\u306A\u3044\u3002\u3060\u3068\u3044\u3046\u306E\u306B\u2026\u2026\n\u305F\u308B\u3093\u3067\u3044\u308B\u306E\u3067\u306F\u306A\u3044\u304B\u300D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "\u0022We Knights of the Midnight Sun must be\nan example to other knights. And yet...\nHave you grown lax?\u0022"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8FEB\u529B\u3084\u3079\u30FC\u3002\u93A7\u59FF\u3067\u8A00\u308F\u308C\u305F\u3089\u3001\n\u6016\u304F\u3066\u6CE3\u3044\u3061\u3083\u3046\u3088\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s scary intense. If she said that while wearing armor,\nI\u0027d probably cry..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u89B3\u5BA2\u306E\u7537\u6027",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Male Audience Member"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3001\u7DCA\u5F35\u304B\u3089\u304B\n\u3000\u529B\u304C\u5165\u3063\u3066\u3044\u3064\u3082\u4EE5\u4E0A\u306B\u8FEB\u529B\u304C\u2026\u2026\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Juna\u0027s nervousness is making her\neven more intense than usual...!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u843D\u3061\u7740\u3044\u3066\u3001\u3044\u3064\u3082\u901A\u308A\u306B\u7B54\u3048\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Stay calm and answer naturally!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u843D\u3061\u7740\u3044\u3066\u3001\u3044\u3064\u3082\u901A\u308A\u306B\u7B54\u3048\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Stay calm and answer naturally!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3060\u306A\u3002\u5C11\u3057\u7DCA\u5F35\u3057\u3066\n\u786C\u304F\u306A\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305F\u3002\u52A9\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3001\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027re right. I was a bit tense and\nstiff. Thank you, Resna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u305A\u306F\u305D\u306E\u9593\u9055\u3044\u306E\u539F\u56E0\u3092\u63A2\u308A\u3001\n\u4ECA\u5F8C\u306E\u5BFE\u7B56\u3092\u8003\u3048\u308B\u3002\u4F1D\u3048\u308B\u3068\u3057\u305F\u3089\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "First, we should find the cause of the mistake,\nand think about how to prevent it in the future.\nWhat I would say is..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u300C\u3069\u3093\u306A\u719F\u7DF4\u8005\u3067\u3082\u3001\u4EBA\u9593\u306A\u306E\u3060\u304B\u3089\n\u9593\u9055\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3082\u3042\u308B\u3060\u308D\u3046\u3002\u4ECA\u56DE\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3092\n\u6B21\u3078\u306E\u7CE7\u3068\u3057\u3001\u5171\u306B\u9811\u5F35\u308D\u3046\u300D\u2026\u2026\u3060\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "\u0022Even experts are human,\nand humans make mistakes. Let\u0027s use this\nas a learning experience and move forward together.\u0022"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7D20\u6575\u2026\u2026\u79C1\u3082\u9A0E\u58EB\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3066\u3001\n\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3068\u4E00\u7DD2\u306B\u50CD\u304D\u305F\u3044\u308F\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How wonderful... I want to become a knight\nand work alongside Juna..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u89B3\u5BA2\u306E\u5973\u6027",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Female Audience Member"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3055\u3059\u304C\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3002\n\u3000\u89B3\u5BA2\u306E\u5FC3\u3092\u304C\u3063\u3061\u308A\u63B4\u3093\u3067\u3044\u307E\u3059\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(As expected of Juna.\nShe\u0027s completely won over the audience!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5148\u8F29\u3055\u3093\u3092\u3001\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u306C\u3044\u3050\u308B\u307F\u3068\u601D\u3063\u3066\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Think of your senior as a cute stuffed animal!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5148\u8F29\u3055\u3093\u3092\u3001\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u306C\u3044\u3050\u308B\u307F\u3068\u601D\u3063\u3066\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Think of your senior as a cute stuffed animal!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u306B\u3063\uFF01\uFF1F\n\u3042\u3001\u3042\u30FC\u3001\u3048\u30FC\u3068\u3001\u305D\u3046\u3060\u306A\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What!?\nAh, um, well..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u300C\u307E\u3001\u9593\u9055\u3048\u3066\u3057\u307E\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3082\u3042\u308B\u3060\u308D\u3046\u3002\n\u3060\u3001\u3060\u304B\u3089\u305D\u306E\u3001\u3042\u307E\u308A\u843D\u3061\u8FBC\u3080\u306A\u2026\u2026\u300D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "\u0022S-sometimes we make mistakes.\nSo, um, don\u0027t feel too down about it...\u0022"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u3093\u304B\u3044\u3064\u3082\u306E\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3063\u307D\u304F\u306A\u3044\u304B\u3082\u2026\u2026\n\u3051\u3069\u306A\u3093\u3060\u304B\u3001\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This doesn\u0027t seem like the usual Juna...\nbut somehow, Juna\u0027s being really cute...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u89B3\u5BA2\u306E\u5973\u6027",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Female Audience Member"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u306B\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u306C\u3044\u3050\u308B\u307F\u3092\n\u3000\u6CE8\u610F\u3055\u305B\u308B\u306E\u306F\u8F9B\u3044\u3053\u3068\u3060\u3063\u305F\u304B\u3082\uFF01\uFF1F\n\u3000\u3053\u306E\u4F8B\u3048\u306F\u5931\u6557\u3067\u3057\u305F\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Maybe making Juna scold a cute stuffed animal\nwas too much for her!?\nThis example was a mistake...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u3053\u307E\u3067\u51FA\u5834\u8005\u306E\u65B9\u306B\n\u304A\u7B54\u3048\u3044\u305F\u3060\u304D\u307E\u3057\u305F\u304C\u3001\n\u6700\u5F8C\u306F\u52A9\u624B\u306E\u65B9\u306B\u304A\u7B54\u3048\u3044\u305F\u3060\u304D\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We\u0027ve heard from our contestants,\nbut now it\u0027s time for\nthe assistants to answer!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u53F8\u4F1A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Host"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305A\u3070\u308A\uFF01\u3000\u52A9\u624B\u306E\u65B9\u304B\u3089\u898B\u305F\n\u51FA\u5834\u8005\u306E\u9B45\u529B\u3068\u306F\uFF01\u3000\u304A\u7B54\u3048\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tell us! What do you find most appealing\nabout your contestant? Please answer!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u53F8\u4F1A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Host"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3001\u983C\u3093\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna, I\u0027m counting on you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u79C1\u304C\u601D\u3046\u3001\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u306E\u9B45\u529B\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(What I find most appealing about Juna...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4E00\u76F4\u7DDA\u306B\u4E00\u6240\u61F8\u547D\u306A\u3068\u3053\u308D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How single-minded and dedicated she is"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u306E\u601D\u3046\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u306E\u9B45\u529B\u306F\u3001\n\u76EE\u6A19\u3092\u5B9A\u3081\u305F\u3089\u305D\u306E\u9054\u6210\u306B\u5411\u3051\u3066\n\u4E00\u76F4\u7DDA\u306B\u4E00\u6240\u61F8\u547D\u306A\u3068\u3053\u308D\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What I find most appealing about Juna is\nhow she gives her all, charging straight ahead\ntoward any goal she sets!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u76EE\u6A19\u306B\u5411\u3051\u3066\u4E00\u6240\u61F8\u547D\u3001\u304B\u2026\u2026\n\u4F8B\u3048\u3070\u3001\u3069\u3093\u306A\u3053\u3068\u3060\u308D\u3046\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Single-minded dedication...\nWhat sort of things do you mean?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3092\u984C\u6750\u306B\u3057\u305F\u672C\u3084\u6B4C\u306B\n\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u304C\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Like in the books and songs about you..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 55,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u306F\u4EBA\u3005\u3092\u82E6\u3057\u3081\u308B\u7ADC\u3092\u5012\u3059\u3079\u304F\u3001\n\u5192\u967A\u8005\u306B\u5E2B\u4E8B\u3057\u3001\u904E\u9177\u306A\u4FEE\u884C\u3092\u4E57\u308A\u8D8A\u3048\u3001\n\u898B\u4E8B\u7ADC\u3092\u8A0E\u3061\u307E\u3057\u305F\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "To defeat the dragon that was terrorizing people,\nyou trained under adventurers, endured harsh training,\nand successfully slayed it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 56,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u308C\u306F\u4E26\u5927\u62B5\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3058\u3083\u3042\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\uFF01\n\u3053\u308C\u3092\u6210\u305B\u305F\u306E\u3082\u3001\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u306E\u4E00\u6240\u61F8\u547D\u3055\u3084\n\u305D\u306E\u5F37\u976D\u306A\u7CBE\u795E\u529B\u3042\u3063\u3066\u3053\u305D\u3060\u3068\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s no small feat!\nIt was only possible because of your dedication\nand strong spirit!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 57,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6B63\u9762\u304B\u3089\u305D\u3046\u8A00\u308F\u308C\u308B\u3068\u3001\u6065\u305A\u304B\u3057\u3044\u304C\u3001\n\u81EA\u4FE1\u304C\u3064\u304F\u306A\u3002\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s embarrassing to hear such direct praise, but\nit does boost my confidence. Thank you, Resna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 58,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u3082\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u306E\u6D3B\u8E8D\u306B\u306F\u3001\u76EE\u3092\u898B\u5F35\u308B\u3082\u306E\u304C\n\u3042\u308B\u3068\u601D\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3002\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u306E\u6D3B\u8E8D\u3082\u305D\u306E\u3046\u3061\n\u672C\u3084\u6B4C\u306B\u306A\u308A\u3001\u8A9E\u308A\u7D99\u304C\u308C\u308B\u304B\u3082\u3057\u308C\u306A\u3044\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m also impressed by your achievements.\nPerhaps one day, books and songs will be written\nabout your exploits as well."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 59,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8CAC\u4EFB\u3042\u308B\u767D\u591C\u306E\u9A0E\u58EB\u306A\u3068\u3053\u308D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Her responsibility as a Knight of the Midnight Sun"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 60,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u306E\u601D\u3046\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u306E\u9B45\u529B\u306F\u3001\n\u8CAC\u4EFB\u3042\u308B\u767D\u591C\u306E\u9A0E\u58EB\u3060\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What I find most appealing about Juna is\nher responsibility as a Knight of the Midnight Sun!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 61,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u767D\u591C\u306E\u9A0E\u58EB\u3001\u3067\u3042\u308B\u3068\u3044\u3046\u306E\u306F\n\u9B45\u529B\u306B\u306A\u308B\u306E\u3060\u308D\u3046\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Being a Knight of the Midnight Sun...\nis that really something appealing?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 62,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3042\u3042\uFF01\u3000\u3053\u308C\u3067\u306F\u9A0E\u58EB\u3067\u306A\u3044\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u306B\u306F\n\u3000\u9B45\u529B\u304C\u306A\u3044\u3068\u3082\u3068\u3089\u308C\u304B\u306D\u306A\u3044\u304B\u3082\uFF01\n\u3000\u8A00\u8449\u9078\u3073\u3092\u9593\u9055\u3048\u307E\u3057\u305F\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Oh no! This might sound like\nJuna has no appeal outside of being a knight!\nI chose my words poorly...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 63,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u9A0E\u58EB\u3068\u3057\u3066\u306E\u79C1\u3092\u9B45\u529B\u306B\u601D\u3063\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3048\u3066\u3044\u308B\n\u306E\u306A\u3089\u3001\u79C1\u306F\u3053\u308C\u304B\u3089\u3082\u9A0E\u58EB\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3001\n\u5F37\u304F\u6B63\u3057\u304F\u5728\u308D\u3046\u3002\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If you find appeal in me as a knight,\nthen I shall continue to strive to be\nstrong and righteous as one. Thank you, Resna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 64,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3068\u3063\u3066\u3082\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u3068\u3053\u308D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How incredibly cute she is"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 65,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u306F\u3068\u3063\u3066\u3082\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u4EBA\u306A\u3093\u3067\u3059\uFF01\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna is such an incredibly cute person!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 66,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u3001\u304A\u3044\uFF01\u3000\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "H-hey! Resna!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 67,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u30CF\u30C3\uFF01\u3000\u3064\u3044\u52E2\u3044\u3067\u8A00\u3063\u3061\u3083\u3063\u305F\uFF01\n\u3000\u9A0E\u58EB\u306E\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u50CF\u3092\u58CA\u3055\u306A\u3044\u305F\u3081\u306B\u3082\n\u3000\u306A\u3093\u3068\u304B\u3054\u307E\u304B\u3055\u306A\u3044\u3068\u2026\u2026\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Ah! I got carried away and just blurted it out!\nI need to cover this up somehow\nto preserve Juna\u0027s knightly image...!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 68,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3063\u3068\u3001\u304B\u3063\u3053\u3044\u3044\uFF01\u3000\u304B\u3063\u3053\u3044\u3044\u3067\u3057\u305F\uFF01\n\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u306F\u3068\u3063\u3066\u3082\u304B\u3063\u3053\u3044\u3044\u3093\u3067\u3059\uFF01\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Um, I mean cool! Really cool!\nJuna is such an incredibly cool person!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 69,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3001\u305D\u308C\u3082\u4EBA\u524D\u3067\u9023\u547C\u3055\u308C\u308B\u3068\n\u6065\u305A\u304B\u3057\u3044\u306A\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "T-that\u0027s also embarrassing when you\nkeep saying it in front of everyone..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 70,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3001\u6065\u305A\u304B\u3057\u304C\u3063\u3066\u3066\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u30FC\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna\u0027s being shy, how cute\u2014!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u89B3\u5BA2\u306E\u5973\u6027",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Female Audience Member"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 71,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA\u2015\uFF01\u3000\u3044\u3064\u3082\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u30FC\uFF01\n\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u305C\u30FC\uFF01\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna\u2014! Thanks for everything!\nYou\u0027re so cute!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u89B3\u5BA2\u306E\u7537\u6027",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Male Audience Member"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 72,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u308F\u3001\u79C1\u306F\u304B\u308F\u3044\u304F\u306A\u3069\u2026\u2026\uFF01\n\u304F\u3063\u3001\u3082\u3046\u8A31\u3057\u3066\u304F\u308C\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-I\u0027m not cute at all...!\nPlease, enough..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 73,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306F\u3044\u3001\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\u3054\u3056\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\u30FC\uFF01\n\u3067\u306F\u9806\u4F4D\u767A\u8868\u307E\u3067\u3001\u3057\u3070\u3089\u304F\u304A\u5F85\u3061\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you very much!\nPlease wait a moment while we tally the results."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u53F8\u4F1A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Host"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 74,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u306F\u3001\u7686\u3055\u307E\u304A\u5F85\u3061\u304B\u306D\u3001\n\u512A\u52DD\u8005\u306E\u767A\u8868\u3067\u3059\uFF01\u3000\u512A\u52DD\u306F\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And now, the moment you\u0027ve all been waiting for,\ntime to announce the winner! The winner is...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u53F8\u4F1A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Host"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 75,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "......"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 76,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3086\u3001\u512A\u52DD\u306F\u2026\u2026\uFF01\uFF1F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Th-the winner is...!?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 77,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2015\u2015\u60DC\u3057\u304F\u3082\u6E96\u512A\u52DD\u3068\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u306E\u306F\u3001\n\u767D\u591C\u306E\u9A0E\u58EB\u3001\u30E6\u30CA\u30FB\u30F4\u30A1\u30A4\u30C4\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "\u2014Coming in as our runner-up,\nKnight of the Midnight Sun, Juna Waitz!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u53F8\u4F1A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Host"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 78,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u512A\u52DD\u306F\u9003\u3057\u305F\u304B\u3001\u6B8B\u5FF5\u3060\u3002\u3060\u304C\u697D\u3057\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3002\n\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3082\u3001\u79C1\u3092\u5FDC\u63F4\u3057\u3066\u304F\u308C\u305F\u8005\u3082\n\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\uFF01\u3000\u661F\u306E\u5C0E\u304D\u306B\u611F\u8B1D\u3092",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We missed first place. That\u0027s unfortunate. But it was fun.\nThank you Resna, and everyone who supported me!\nMay the stars guide us all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 79,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u512A\u52DD\u3001\u3067\u304D\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3067\u3057\u305F\u2026\u2026\n\u3000\u512A\u52DD\u8CDE\u54C1\u3092\u898B\u308B\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u306E\u76EE\u3001\n\u3000\u6094\u3057\u3055\u3068\u60B2\u3057\u3055\u3092\u611F\u3058\u307E\u3059\u2026\u2026\u3063\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(We couldn\u0027t win first place...\nLooking at Juna gazing at the winner\u0027s prize,\nI can feel her frustration and sadness...!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]